OL,3,GNEWSA'Day of shame' for ex-council
OL,4,Aleader Jason Zadrozny being sentenced
OL,5,Afor fraud and tax evasion
OL,6,
OL,7,FFormer Ashfield District Council leader
OL,8,FJason Zadrozny is due to be sentenced
OL,9,Ffor fraud and tax evasion
OL,11,FIn his role as Nottinghamshire county
OL,12,Fcouncillor, Zadrozny applied for
OL,13,Ffunding he claimed was to support
OL,14,Fheritage projects in Ashfield, but
OL,15,Fpocketed the money for himself
OL,17,FHe has been told he is "at risk of an
OL,18,Fimmediate custodial sentence", with the
OL,19,Fsentencing judge describing Friday's
OL,20,Fevents as a "day of shame" for Zadrozny
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
